flowchart LR
    F[Unchanged C2 image features] --> D1[Decoder layer 1]
    D1 --> Q1[Original q1]
    Q1 --> B1[Original bbox head 1: b1]
    Q1 --> C1[Original class head 1]
    Q1 --> D2[Decoder layer 2]
    B1 -->|original reference path| D2
    D2 --> Q2[Original q2]
    Q2 --> B2[Original bbox head 2: b2]
    Q2 --> C2[Original class head 2]
    Q2 --> D3[Decoder layer 3]
    B2 -->|original reference path| D3
    D3 --> Q3[Original q3]
    Q3 --> B3[Original bbox head 3: b3]
    B1 -.-> G[detach + FP32 ordered 16D state]
    B2 -.-> G
    B3 -.-> G
    G --> T[tanh geo_proj]
    Q3 --> S[RMS over channels / sem_proj / SiLU]
    S --> M[Multiply / mod_proj / 0.5 tanh]
    T --> M
    Q3 --> A[q_cls = q3 + q3 * Delta]
    M --> A
    A --> W[Original final classification W and bias]
    W --> L[Native classification logits / VFL]
    B3 --> R[Native box output / regression loss]
